DESCRIPTION:Shafi Hossain is a New York City-based stand-up comedian\, writ
 er\, and producer. Originally from Bangladesh\, he moved to the United Stat
 es to study chemical engineering before falling in love with standup comedy
 . Now a regular performer at the prestigious Comedy Cellar\, Shafi has esta
 blished himself as a prominent voice in the NYC comedy scene. He was named 
 one of "New York's Funniest Stand Ups" by the New York Comedy Festival and 
 has been featured on Kevin Hart’s  LOL Network  series  Road Comics  
 on Peacock. Shafi has toured internationally—headlining shows in London\,
  Paris\, Bangladesh\, and Canada.\n\nCouple's Package includes:\n\n- 2 prem
 ium seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Tic
 ket Protection\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent customers from e
 ntering the facility who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons
 .\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/special-event-shaf
 i-hossain/
